# block-string-blank-lines-within

## Input

```
foo |
  a

  b
bar |
  a
     
  b

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..35
  ENTRY@0..15
    WORD_KEY@0..3
      WORD@0..3 "foo"
    SPACE@3..4 " "
    BLOCK_STRING@4..15
      BLOCK_STRING_HEADER@4..6
        PIPE@4..5 "|"
        NEWLINE@5..6 "\n"
      SPACE@6..8 "  "
      LINE_STRING@8..9
        STRING@8..9 "a"
      NEWLINE@9..10 "\n"
      LINE_STRING@10..10
      NEWLINE@10..11 "\n"
      SPACE@11..13 "  "
      LINE_STRING@13..14
        STRING@13..14 "b"
      NEWLINE@14..15 "\n"
  ENTRY@15..35
    WORD_KEY@15..18
      WORD@15..18 "bar"
    SPACE@18..19 " "
    BLOCK_STRING@19..35
      BLOCK_STRING_HEADER@19..21
        PIPE@19..20 "|"
        NEWLINE@20..21 "\n"
      SPACE@21..23 "  "
      LINE_STRING@23..24
        STRING@23..24 "a"
      NEWLINE@24..25 "\n"
      SPACE@25..30 "     "
      LINE_STRING@30..30
      NEWLINE@30..31 "\n"
      SPACE@31..33 "  "
      LINE_STRING@33..34
        STRING@33..34 "b"
      NEWLINE@34..35 "\n"
```

